      "id": "claim_3d50ef74dc4f4bd298cb245f0617a5e2",
      "statement": "The `✅ CI Success` gate always runs an inline validator that fails closed on missing, unknown, failed, or unexpectedly skipped required job results; lockfile and scheduled hygiene failures block, while `check-release-options` may skip only on unchanged pull requests. It waives only failed Talon lint/test jobs on pull requests with `talon-src=false`, keeps merge-group evaluation strict, and tolerates a push cancellation only when a branch-head lookup proves the run was superseded.",
